==English==

===Etymology===
From a 1990 article by Morning Glory Zell-Ravenheart, "A Bouquet of Lovers", from {{pre|en|poly|amorous}}.

===Adjective===
{{en-adj|-}}

# Having [[relationship]]s with multiple [[partner]]s, with the knowledge and consent of all involved; engaging in [[polyamory]].
# Open to having such relationships, regardless of one's experience or current practices.

====Synonyms====
* {{alt|en|poly||informal}}
* {{alt|en|polyam||informal}}

